# Max File Length: 200 Lines

No project file may exceed **200 lines**.

## When writing or editing

- Before finishing a change, check the resulting file length.
- If a file would exceed 200 lines, split it before saving.
- Prefer extracting helpers, hooks, components, types, or constants into sibling modules.

## How to split

- One concern per file
- Colocate related pieces under the same folder
- Prefer more small files over one large file

## Exceptions

- Generated files (`node_modules/`, `.next/`, lockfiles) are exempt
- Do not grow an existing file past 200 lines; split instead
